# Streaming AArch64 linear code emitter
# Transport sends a marker and an unmodified source byte per record
# A zero marker terminates source input
# Ignored source characters are discarded inside Brainfuck
# Each recognized linear command emits one tag and forty eight code bytes
# Brackets cause a terminal error status
# No fixed source count or output slot count is stored
# This stage emits native slots but does not construct ELF
